.TH FILEFORGE-CLI 1 "FileForge 2.0"
.SH NAME
fileforge-cli \- perform file conversions via FileForge engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fileforge-cli
.RB [ --from " EXT" ]
.RB [ --to " EXT[,EXT...]" ]
.RB [ --input " FILE" ]
.RB [ --output " FILE" ]
.RB [ --force ]
.RB [ --verbose ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
fileforge-cli executes conversions using the FileForge engine. It supports
image, video, audio, and document formats depending on installed backends.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --from " EXT"
Source extension (e.g. png, mp4, mp3).
.TP
.BR --to " EXT[,EXT...]"
Target extension(s). Multiple extensions can be comma-separated.
.TP
.BR --input " FILE"
Input file path.
.TP
.BR --output " FILE"
Output file path.
.TP
.BR --force
Overwrite existing output file.
.TP
.BR --verbose
Print detailed conversion logs.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B fileforge-cli --from png --to jpg --input in.png --output out.jpg
.br
Convert a PNG image to JPG.
